 "sentences": [
  {
   "sid": "4-02.s1",
   "text": "Before, you'd need a lab-measured structure.",
   "w_first": "4-02.w001",
   "w_last": "4-02.w006",
   "f0": 2,
   "f1": 148
  },
  {
   "sid": "4-02.s2",
   "text": "Now?",
   "w_first": "4-02.w007",
   "w_last": "4-02.w007",
   "f0": 206,
   "f1": 221
  },
  {
   "sid": "4-02.s3",
   "text": "The team just downloaded a prediction, for free, from a public database.",
   "w_first": "4-02.w008",
   "w_last": "4-02.w019",
   "f0": 259,
   "f1": 573
  },
  {
   "sid": "4-02.s4",
   "text": "According to the paper, this was the first time AlphaFold had been used to find a hit like this.",
